# Slackware-compatible PS3 bootstrap candidates.
# Every archive MUST be rebuilt/provided for PowerPC64 big-endian (ppc64),
# with a mutually compatible libc/ABI. This list is a package-name contract,
# not proof that official Slackware ships these packages for PS3.
aaa_base
aaa_libraries
bash
bin
coreutils
glibc-solibs
grep
gzip
sed
tar
util-linux
e2fsprogs
pkgtools
sysvinit
sysvinit-scripts
shadow
